4220e9fcf912dd0f4c1fbc7400bdb5fb2999fe\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.1.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 3 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - AMD Radeon RX 6700 XT (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.21030.2001) - AMD Ryzen 7 5800X3D 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 31.91 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\n`reload_scene_from_path` cannot be called more than once per frame; future calls simply do nothing.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open the MRP\n- Open scene1, scene2, and scene3.\n- In the sidebar, there should be 4 buttons.\n- Click the fourth button.\n\n<img width=\"487\" height=\"204\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d7de076b-6e4a-4475-96b3-f7b0e43cd77b\" />\n\n-  It will update all three scenes on disk to add a node. But in Godot, only `scene1` will be reloaded to match the disk's changes.\n\n<img width=\"566\" height=\"309\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9d938ff7-4950-4b4c-97a1-884ba7210598\" />\n\n- When you tab out and back, Godot will warn that the two un-reloaded scenes have been updated on disk: \n\n<img width=\"606\" height=\"387\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ce347b7a-4244-49f7-8176-ab8026608088\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[reload_scene_from_path_issues.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25616529/reload_scene_from_path_issues.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.gi